Source: nginx-clientfp
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Maintainer: nginx-clientfp maintainers <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libpcre2-dev, zlib1g-dev, perl, binutils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://nginx.org

Package: nginx-clientfp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ssl-cert
Conflicts: nginx, nginx-common, nginx-core, nginx-full, nginx-light, nginx-extras
Replaces: nginx, nginx-common, nginx-core, nginx-full, nginx-light, nginx-extras
Provides: nginx, httpd, httpd-cgi
Description: nginx @NGINX_VERSION@ with JA4 and HTTP/2 client fingerprinting
 nginx web and reverse proxy server, statically linked with OpenSSL
 @OPENSSL_VERSION@, plus ngx_http_clientfp_module. The module computes the JA4
 TLS client fingerprint and the Akamai HTTP/2 client fingerprint of every
 connection, exposes them as $clientfp_* variables and can pass them to
 upstream servers as request headers that clients cannot spoof.
 .
 Debian/Ubuntu file layout (sites-available, sites-enabled, snippets,
 modules-enabled). Replaces the distribution's nginx packages.
